Icon set — provenance and license
==================================

These 16 icons are drawn in the Lucide (https://lucide.dev) visual style: 24x24
viewBox, stroke="currentColor", stroke-width="2", round caps and joins, no fill.
Lucide ships under the ISC license (a permissive license functionally
equivalent to MIT):

  ISC License

  Copyright (c) for portions of Lucide are held by Cole Bemis 2013-2022 as part
  of Feather (MIT). All other copyright for Lucide are held by Lucide Contributors
  2022-present.

  Permission to use, copy, modify, and/or distribute this software for any
  purpose with or without fee is hereby granted, provided that the above
  copyright notice and this permission notice appear in all copies.

  THE SOFTWARE IS PROVIDED "AS IS" AND THE AUTHOR DISCLAIMS ALL WARRANTIES WITH
  REGARD TO THIS SOFTWARE INCLUDING ALL IMPLIED WARRANTIES OF MERCHANTABILITY AND
  FITNESS. IN NO EVENT SHALL THE AUTHOR BE LIABLE FOR ANY SPECIAL, DIRECT,
  INDIRECT, OR CONSEQUENTIAL DAMAGES OR ANY DAMAGES WHATSOEVER RESULTING FROM
  LOSS OF USE, DATA OR PROFITS, WHETHER IN AN ACTION OF CONTRACT, NEGLIGENCE OR
  OTHER TORTIOUS ACTION, ARISING OUT OF OR IN CONNECTION WITH THE USE OR
  PERFORMANCE OF THIS SOFTWARE.

Provenance note: these particular SVG files were authored for this plugin in the
Lucide style (same viewBox, stroke conventions, and glyph concepts as Lucide's
published set) rather than copied byte-for-byte from the Lucide package, because
this build had no package registry or network access to vendor the originals
directly. If exact upstream fidelity matters, replace any file here with the
corresponding icon from `lucide-static` (npm) — same filename, same 24x24 stroke
convention, drop-in compatible.
